ogether), e.g. I've got some", "h": 0.015107460409295271, "w": 0.3491366916232639, "x": 0.5633553126852333}, {"text": "chocolate. I've got a bar of chocolate.", "x": 0.5635062683088434, "w": 0.261180674235026, "y": 0.17703488397710168, "h": 0.01141276953452761}, {"x": 0.570661898301546, "y": 0.20359011647622957, "w": 0.37567084418402774, "h": 0.011554287852793362, "text": "Look in your fridge at home. Complete the sentences"}, {"w": 0.372092997233073, "text": "about the food you can see in the fridge. Check any", "x": 0.5706619153965821, "y": 0.21749999972314965, "h": 0.012645349063597886}, {"h": 0.011549722649130057, "w": 0.19141323513454855, "x": 0.5706618992335606, "text": "new words in a dictionary.", "y": 0.23124097475857935}, {"w": 0.1484794277615017, "text": "In my fridge, there is:", "h": 0.012750346126969408, "x": 0.568872987349124, "y": 0.24911337251230778}, {"text": "In my fridge, there are:", "x": 0.7656529485225878, "h": 0.0127503461269696, "y": 0.24911337239639197, "w": 0.159212883843316}, {"x": 0.5706618964666195, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "y": 0.26175872096555575, "w": 0.008944543202718092, "text": "1"}, {"y": 0.26302325596053183, "x": 0.5957066206905874, "text": "a carton of milk", "h": 0.011403639501613013, "w": 0.10912343343098962}, {"y": 0.27566860498659024, "w": 0.008944543202718092, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "x": 0.570661896623149, "text": "2"}, {"x": 0.547145880250482, "w": 0.21700629340277777, "text": "3 Choose the correct option.", "h": 0.014856227812784133, "y": 0.3120252166964362}, {"w": 0.3613595581054687, "x": 0.5688729901422567, "y": 0.33130813982139207, "text": "Lisa: This healthy food camp is a great idea but it's", "h": 0.01264534831477405}, {"h": 0.012955776173285286, "text": "a long walk to get there. Have you got a drink?", "y": 0.345094765428251, "w": 0.3220035807291667, "x": 0.6189624265107894}, {"y": 0.3591279072379618, "w": 0.21288013034396702, "h": 0.012663609129427076, "x": 0.568872997410008, "text": "Chris: Yes. I've got some cola."}, {"h": 0.011616788796999834, "w": 0.0377090962727864, "text": "Lisa:", "y": 0.37291980319393303, "x": 0.5670130730835229}, {"w": 0.3023255750868056, "h": 0.012713825246487384, "x": 0.6028622521405568, "text": "Cola! That isn't healthy. I've got two small", "y": 0.3729693140271788}, {"h": 0.012718390075738675, "x": 0.6189624420221918, "text": "'cartons / boxes / packets of juice.", "y": 0.3869476746798222, "w": 0.2379248555501302}, {"text": "Ten minutes later...", "w": 0.1377459716796875, "y": 0.4046511630418228, "x": 0.5688729914111996, "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"text": "Chris: Oh, great, a shop. Wait a minute.", "y": 0.41851083027632735, "x": 0.5688729976487766, "w": 0.2790697564019098, "h": 0.01143102997476862}, {"w": 0.23076922946506084, "h": 0.01155885305645657, "text": "Lisa: What do you want to buy?", "y": 0.43247093051281593, "x": 0.568872986481372}, {"w": 0.35599283854166675, "h": 0.013909883895075349, "y": 0.4451162789300059, "text": "Chris: A small tub / bottle / jar of ketchup. Cheese", "x": 0.5670840845902281}, {"w": 0.2737030368381076, "x": 0.6171735297249532, "h": 0.011545157445466848, "y": 0.4601263539315376, "text": "sandwiches are boring without ketchup."}, {"text": "Lisa: You could buy a tomato and some lettuce to", "y": 0.47293604655704347, "w": 0.35420393202039924, "h": 0.011531462583300867, "x": 0.567084076327308}, {"y": 0.4880009026888525, "h": 0.011490376124743525, "w": 0.18604649861653644, "text": "make it nicer. Not ketchup.", "x": 0.6189624425223818}, {"x": 0.5670840780540144, "h": 0.01141276953452761, "text": "Half an hour later...", "y": 0.5032848840192528, "w": 0.1377459716796876}, {"text": "Lisa: We've still got five kilometres to go. Let's stop", "x": 0.5652951829859266, "w": 0.3649373711480034, "y": 0.5184593027448658, "h": 0.012727520483065188}, {"h": 0.011385379061371907, "w": 0.3023255750868056, "y": 0.5323646207667592, "text": "and eat. Have you got something for lunch?", "x": 0.6153846135001276}, {"y": 0.544927797